        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "8836e263-227d-4841-ac57-11e0a73e586f",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "7da62f6e-a658-4941-a79d-eb867ff050fe",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "ab1db4be-de23-4513-a76d-f1367bf3f75f",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "A second shipment\nhas a tin of soup\nand a packet of\npaper medicine\nlabels. The clinic",
                      "takes the labels\nand requires a dry\ncontainer. Cocoa\ntakes soup and can\naccept a washable",
                      "crate. The only\ndry box holds the\nsoup; the washable\ncrate holds the\nlabels. Both",
                      "containers have\ncorrect address\ntags for their\ncontents. Moxie\nsays the tags are",
                      "right but the\npacking still\nneeds a decision."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "ccdef7f0-2bf0-433c-afc6-3b3b75e4e56d",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
